---
// Products preview — parent variant only.
// Descriptor suffix is the sub-brand (— SAB/works), not the product's domain;
// the domain belongs on the product's own landing page.
---
<section id="products" class="border-b border-brand-rule px-6 py-14">

  <!-- Section-inner: label column + intro line -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-[140px_1fr] md:gap-10 items-start mb-7">
    <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] text-fg-tertiary uppercase md:pt-1 pb-2 md:pb-0 border-b md:border-b-0 border-brand-rule">
      Products
    </div>
    <div class="font-sans text-fg-secondary text-[13px] leading-[1.8]">
      Two products. Same philosophy. Different audiences.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Product card grid -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-[2px] bg-brand-rule">

    <article class="bg-brand-surface p-9 flex flex-col">
      <div class="border-l-[3px] border-brand-red pl-4 flex flex-col gap-1 mb-6">
        <span class="font-display font-bold text-fg-primary tracking-[-0.03em] leading-none text-[clamp(24px,5vw,36px)]">
          OffBeat<span class="text-brand-red font-mono font-normal text-[0.52em] ml-[3px] tracking-[0.04em] align-middle">FM</span>
        </span>
        <span class="font-mono text-fg-tertiary tracking-[0.16em] text-[9px] border-t-[0.5px] border-brand-dim pt-2 mt-1.5">
          INDEPENDENT MUSIC DISCOVERY — SAB/works
        </span>
      </div>
      <p class="font-sans text-fg-secondary text-[13px] leading-[1.8] flex-1 mb-5">
        Music discovery for people who are tired of playlists.
        <em class="not-italic text-fg-primary">No algorithms. No editorial committees.</em>
        Independent artists, real metadata, and a platform that makes it possible to find something you've never heard.
      </p>
      <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-1 mb-5">
        <li class="font-mono text-[9px] tracking-[0.12em] text-fg-tertiary border-[0.5px] border-brand-dim px-[7px] py-[3px] uppercase">Independent</li>
        <li class="font-mono text-[9px] tracking-[0.12em] text-fg-tertiary border-[0.5px] border-brand-dim px-[7px] py-[3px] uppercase">Discovery</li>
        <li class="font-mono text-[9px] tracking-[0.12em] text-fg-tertiary border-[0.5px] border-brand-dim px-[7px] py-[3px] uppercase">No algorithms</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="https://offbeat-fm.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
         class="self-start font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.14em] text-fg-tertiary hover:text-fg-primary uppercase border border-brand-dim hover:border-brand-mid px-[14px] py-2 transition-colors duration-150">
        Learn more →
      </a>
    </article>

    <article class="bg-brand-surface p-9 flex flex-col">
      <div class="border-l-[3px] border-brand-red pl-4 flex flex-col gap-1 mb-6">
        <span class="font-display font-bold text-fg-primary tracking-[-0.03em] leading-none text-[clamp(24px,5vw,36px)]">
          <span class="text-fg-tertiary font-normal tracking-[-0.02em]">Get</span>Write
        </span>
        <span class="font-mono text-fg-tertiary tracking-[0.16em] text-[9px] border-t-[0.5px] border-brand-dim pt-2 mt-1.5">
          LOCAL-FIRST WRITING STUDIO — SAB/works
        </span>
      </div>
      <p class="font-sans text-fg-secondary text-[13px] leading-[1.8] flex-1 mb-5">
        A writing environment built around your process, not mine.
        <em class="not-italic text-fg-primary">Local-first. Your files. Your structure.</em>
        Revision control, resource management, and an editor that disappears when you need to think.
      </p>
      <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-1 mb-5">
        <li class="font-mono text-[9px] tracking-[0.12em] text-fg-tertiary border-[0.5px] border-brand-dim px-[7px] py-[3px] uppercase">Local-first</li>
        <li class="font-mono text-[9px] tracking-[0.12em] text-fg-tertiary border-[0.5px] border-brand-dim px-[7px] py-[3px] uppercase">Long-form</li>
        <li class="font-mono text-[9px] tracking-[0.12em] text-fg-tertiary border-[0.5px] border-brand-dim px-[7px] py-[3px] uppercase">Revision control</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="https://getwrite.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
         class="self-start font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.14em] text-fg-tertiary hover:text-fg-primary uppercase border border-brand-dim hover:border-brand-mid px-[14px] py-2 transition-colors duration-150">
        Available now →
      </a>
    </article>

  </div>

</section>
